{
  "lessonId": "L2M3L2",
  "title": "Apulia (Puglia) 普利亞",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e67e22 0%,#d35400 100%)'><h1>🌞 Apulia (Puglia)</h1><p class='subtitle'>義大利的「酒窖」與 Primitivo 之鄉</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 義大利產量第一或第二的產區</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Apulia（義大利文：Puglia，普利亞）位於義大利「靴子」的<strong>鞋跟</strong>部分，是義大利<strong>產量最大或第二大的葡萄酒產區</strong>（與 Veneto 競爭），但歷史上以<strong>散裝酒</strong>為主。</p><p class='highlight'>🌅 近 20 年 Apulia 葡萄酒革命：從散裝酒 → 高品質瓶裝酒，Primitivo 和 Negroamaro 成為國際明星品種。</p></div><div class='apulia-stats'><div class='stat-box production'><div class='stat-num'>1-2</div><div class='stat-label'>產量排名<br>（義大利）</div></div><div class='stat-box sun'><div class='stat-num'>300+</div><div class='stat-label'>年日照天數<br>（最陽光充足的產區）</div></div><div class='stat-box coast'><div class='stat-num'>800km</div><div class='stat-label'>海岸線<br>（Adriatic + Ionian）</div></div><div class='stat-box docs'><div class='stat-num'>4 DOCG<br>29 DOC</div><div class='stat-label'>產區數量</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Primitivo - Apulia 之星</h2><div class='primitivo-section'><div class='primitivo-intro'><h3>🌟 = Zinfandel（美國加州）</h3><p>Primitivo 與美國加州的<strong>Zinfandel 是同一品種</strong>（DNA 證明），但風格略有不同。品種原產自克羅埃西亞（Crljenak Kaštelanski），19 世紀引進義大利。</p><div class='name-meaning'><p><strong>「Primitivo」名稱來源：</strong>義大利文「Primo」（第一），因為是<strong>最早成熟的品種之一</strong>（8 月底-9 月初）。</p></div></div><div class='primitivo-styles'><div class='style-card modern'><h4>🍷 現代風格</h4><div class='style-details'><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香爆炸、酒體飽滿、甜美</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑莓果醬、櫻桃、李子、巧克力、香草、甘草</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>14-16%（高）</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>柔順、成熟</p><p><strong>釀造：</strong>新橡木桶、國際化風格</p><p><strong>代表產區：</strong>Primitivo di Manduria DOP</p></div></div><div class='style-card traditional'><h4>🍇 傳統風格</h4><div class='style-details'><p><strong>風格：</strong>更清爽、更優雅、酸度更明顯</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅色莓果、香料、草本、礦物</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14.5%</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>中等</p><p><strong>釀造：</strong>不銹鋼桶或舊橡木桶</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>更接近義大利傳統風格</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 Primitivo 的兩大 DOCG</h2><div class='primitivo-docgs'><div class='docg-card manduria'><h3>Primitivo di Manduria Dolce Naturale DOCG</h3><p class='docg-badge sweet'>甜型版本（2011 DOCG）</p><div class='docg-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Manduria 鎮（Taranto 省）</p><p><strong>釀造：</strong>葡萄園自然風乾（Appassimento）或過熟採收</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>甜型（Dolce）或半甜（Amabile）</p><p><strong>殘糖：</strong>50-100+ g/L</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>乾果、無花果、葡萄乾、巧克力、咖啡、甘草</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>16-18%</p><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>10-20 年</p><p><strong>配餐：</strong>巧克力甜點、藍紋起司、堅果塔</p></div></div><div class='docg-card gioia'><h3>Gioia del Colle Primitivo Riserva DOCG</h3><p class='docg-badge dry'>不甜版本（2020 DOCG，最新）</p><div class='docg-info'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Gioia del Colle（Bari 省內陸丘陵）</p><p><strong>海拔：</strong>350-500m（比 Manduria 高，更涼爽）</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Primitivo（85%+）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>不甜、更優雅、酸度更高</p><p><strong>陳年：</strong>Riserva 至少 2 年</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅色莓果、香料、草本、礦物</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>比 Manduria 更精緻、更有結構</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Negroamaro - Apulia 的另一顆明珠</h2><div class='negroamaro-section'><div class='negroamaro-intro'><h3>🖤「雙重黑色」</h3><p>Negroamaro 名稱來自拉丁文「Niger」（黑）+ 希臘文「Mavro」（黑）= <strong>「雙重黑色」</strong>，是 Salento 半島（Apulia 南部）的<strong>代表性紅葡萄品種</strong>。</p></div><div class='negroamaro-features'><div class='feature-card'><h4>🍇 品種特性</h4><ul><li>顏色極深（接近黑色）</li><li>單寧中至高、成熟柔順</li><li>酒精度 13-14.5%</li><li>抗旱性強（適合炎熱氣候）</li><li>風味：黑李子、黑櫻桃、香料、草本、煙草、巧克力</li></ul></div><div class='feature-card'><h4>🍷 主要產區</h4><p><strong>Salice Salentino DOC（最知名）：</strong></p><ul><li>Negroamaro（75%+）+ Malvasia Nera</li><li>風格：濃郁、果香、柔順</li><li>Riserva：陳年 24 個月</li></ul><p><strong>Copertino DOC：</strong></p><ul><li>Negroamaro（70%+）+ Malvasia Nera、Sangiovese</li><li>風格：更輕盈、易飲</li></ul></div><div class='feature-card'><h4>🌸 Rosato（粉紅酒）</h4><p>Negroamaro 也常用於釀造<strong>粉紅酒</strong>，色澤深邃、風味濃郁。</p><p><strong>Five Roses（五朵玫瑰）：</strong></p><ul><li>Leone de Castris 酒莊的經典 Rosato</li><li>義大利第一個瓶裝 Rosato（1943）</li><li>風味：草莓、櫻桃、花香、草本</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⚪ Apulia 白葡萄酒</h2><div class='white-wines-section'><div class='white-card'><h3>Verdeca</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>名稱：</strong>「Verde」（綠色）</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>清爽、高酸度、礦物感</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、青蘋果、杏仁、草本</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Martina Franca、Locorotondo DOC</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>Apulia 最清爽的白酒</p></div></div><div class='white-card'><h3>Bombino Bianco</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>風格：</strong>輕盈、花香、易飲</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>白花、柑橘、杏仁</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Castel del Monte DOC</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>日常飲用型白酒</p></div></div><div class='white-card'><h3>Fiano、Greco（引進品種）</h3><div class='wine-info'><p><strong>來源：</strong>從 Campania 引進</p><p><strong>產區：</strong>Castel del Monte DOC</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>類似 Campania 版本，但更果香、酒精度更高</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>展現 Apulia 陽光充足的特色</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏰 Castel del Monte DOC</h2><div class='castel-section'><div class='castel-intro'><h3>👑 Apulia 最多樣化的產區</h3><p>Castel del Monte（蒙特堡）是 13 世紀神聖羅馬帝國皇帝 Frederick II 建造的<strong>八角形城堡</strong>（UNESCO 世界遺產），周圍的 DOC 產區以<strong>多樣性</strong>著稱。</p></div><div class='castel-wines'><div class='wine-type red'><h4>🍷 紅酒</h4><ul><li><strong>Castel del Monte Rosso：</strong>Nero di Troia、Aglianico、Montepulciano</li><li><strong>Castel del Monte Nero di Troia Riserva DOCG（2011）：</strong>Apulia 最優雅的紅酒之一</li></ul></div><div class='wine-type rose'><h4>🌸 粉紅酒</h4><ul><li><strong>Castel del Monte Rosato：</strong>Bombino Nero（獨特黑葡萄品種）</li><li>風味：草莓、櫻桃、花香、礦物</li></ul></div><div class='wine-type white'><h4>⚪ 白酒</h4><ul><li><strong>Castel del Monte Bianco：</strong>Pampanuto、Bombino Bianco</li><li><strong>單一品種：</strong>Fiano、Greco、Chardonnay</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Apulia 美食與配餐</h2><div class='apulia-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🌾 簡樸的農村與海鮮料理</h3><p>Apulia 料理以<strong>橄欖油、番茄、手工義大利麵（Orecchiette）、海鮮、野菜</strong>為核心，風格簡樸、食材優質。</p></div><div class='food-pairing-grid'><div class='food-item'><h4>🍝 Orecchiette con Cime di Rapa</h4><p class='dish-desc'>耳朵麵配蕪菁菜（Apulia 代表料理）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Primitivo（不甜版本）</li><li>Negroamaro</li><li>Verdeca（白酒版本）</li></ul></div><div class='food-item'><h4>🐙 Polpo alla Pignata</h4><p class='dish-desc'>陶罐燉章魚</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Negroamaro Rosato</li><li>Bombino Bianco</li></ul></div><div class='food-item'><h4>🧀 Burrata 起司</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Apulia 發明的奶油起司</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Locorotondo Bianco（清爽白酒）</li><li>Primitivo Rosato</li></ul></div><div class='food-item'><h4>🥩 烤羊肉、馬肉</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Apulia 傳統紅肉料理</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Primitivo di Manduria</li><li>Salice Salentino Riserva</li><li>Castel del Monte Nero di Troia</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Apulia 是義大利產量第一或第二大的葡萄酒產區</div><div class='point'>✓ Primitivo = Zinfandel（美國加州），名稱來自「最早成熟」</div><div class='point'>✓ Primitivo di Manduria Dolce Naturale 是甜型版本，酒精度 16-18%</div><div class='point'>✓ Negroamaro（雙重黑色）是 Salento 半島的代表品種</div><div class='point'>✓ Castel del Monte DOC 以多樣性著稱，擁有紅、白、粉紅酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Orecchiette con Cime di Rapa 是 Apulia 代表料理</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #e67e22;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.apulia-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.stat-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e67e22,#d35400);padding:25px 20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.stat-num{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.3}.stat-label{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;opacity:.95}.primitivo-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.primitivo-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px}.primitivo-intro h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.4rem}.primitivo-intro>p{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;padding:0 30px}.name-meaning{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #8e44ad}.name-meaning p{margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.name-meaning strong{color:#8e44ad}.primitivo-styles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.style-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.style-card.modern{border-color:#e74c3c}.style-card.traditional{border-color:#27ae60}.style-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.3rem}.style-card.modern h4{color:#e74c3c}.style-card.traditional h4{color:#27ae60}.style-details p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.style-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.primitivo-docgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.docg-card{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.docg-card.manduria{border-color:#e67e22}.docg-card.gioia{border-color:#3498db}.docg-card h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:1.2rem}.docg-card.manduria h3{color:#e67e22}.docg-card.gioia h3{color:#3498db}.docg-badge{display:inline-block;padding:5px 15px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;color:#fff}.docg-badge.sweet{background:#e67e22}.docg-badge.dry{background:#3498db}.docg-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.docg-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.negroamaro-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.negroamaro-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5d6d7,#e8e9ea);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.negroamaro-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.4rem}.negroamaro-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.negroamaro-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.feature-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #34495e}.feature-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#34495e;font-size:1.1rem}.feature-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.feature-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.feature-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.white-wines-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.white-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid #3498db}.white-card h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.2rem}.wine-info p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.wine-info strong{color:#2c3e50}.castel-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.castel-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fce4ec);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.castel-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.4rem}.castel-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.castel-wines{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.wine-type{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid}.wine-type.red{border-color:#c0392b}.wine-type.rose{border-color:#e91e63}.wine-type.white{border-color:#3498db}.wine-type h4{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.1rem}.wine-type.red h4{color:#c0392b}.wine-type.rose h4{color:#e91e63}.wine-type.white h4{color:#3498db}.wine-type ul{margin:0;padding-left:25px;line-height:2}.apulia-cuisine{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cuisine-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cuisine-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.3rem}.cuisine-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.food-pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.food-item{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #d35400}.food-item h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.1rem}.dish-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:.95rem}.food-item p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.food-item ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.food-item strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fef5e7,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
